@startuml
title 图4-8 春联售卖系统业务功能模块图

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "C 端：微信小程序" as C #E8F4FF {
  rectangle "商品与内容\n浏览/搜索/详情/评价" as M1
  rectangle "购物车与结算" as M2
  rectangle "订单与售后\n下单/支付/物流状态" as M3
  rectangle "春联定制\n选项/排队/进度" as M4
  rectangle "AI 助手\n对话/推荐商品" as M5
}

package "B 端：管理后台" as B #FFF4E8 {
  rectangle "商品与库存管理" as A1
  rectangle "订单与定制单处理" as A2
  rectangle "数据统计与运维" as A3
}

package "后端统一服务（Spring Boot）" as BE #F0F0F0 {
  rectangle "REST API\n鉴权与路由" as API
  rectangle "业务逻辑\n商品/订单/购物车/\n定制/AI" as SVC
  rectangle "数据与缓存\nMyBatis / Redis" as DAO
}

M1 -down-> API
M2 -down-> API
M3 -down-> API
M4 -down-> API
M5 -down-> API

A1 -down-> API
A2 -down-> API
A3 -down-> API

API -down-> SVC
SVC -down-> DAO

note bottom of DAO
  与图4-2对照：本图强调业务功能域，图4-2强调技术分层。
end note

@enduml
